==Other Appearances==
==={{AoC|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Descriptions AoC}}
In {{AoC}}, the Climbing Boots are a piece of [[Attire]] that can only be worn by [[Link]] and are obtained when the [[Warrior]]s complete the [[Quest]] "[[Perils of Mount Hylia]]". They can also be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

